sequenceDiagram
    autonumber

    box rgba(31, 67, 77, 0.35) Rephora Mobile Client
        participant App as Flutter App
    end

    box rgba(34, 66, 41, 0.35) Spring Boot Monolith
        participant API as GraphQL API
    end

    box rgba(90, 63, 30, 0.30) AWS Serverless
        participant EventBridge as EventBridge every 10 min
        participant Gardener as rephora-gardener Lambda Python 3.12
    end

    box rgba(77, 57, 98, 0.22) DynamoDB
        participant Users as users table and gsi_deleted_at
        participant Data as user-owned tables
    end

    rect rgba(244, 241, 232, 0.07)
        Note over App,Users: Deletion request stores markers and does not purge synchronously
        App->>API: requestDeletion(requestDataExport)
        API->>Users: set deletedAt = now and requestDataExport = flag
        API-->>App: Deletion scheduled with 10 day grace period
        Note over Users: deletedAt is the only deletion marker.
    end

    rect rgba(31, 67, 77, 0.12)
        Note over App,Users: Reactivation clears the marker before Gardener can purge
        App->>API: requestReactivation
        API->>Users: clear deletedAt and requestDataExport = false
        API-->>App: Account reactivated
    end

    rect rgba(224, 169, 109, 0.08)
        Note over EventBridge,Data: Gardener scans pending deletions and purges only expired accounts
        EventBridge->>Gardener: Trigger scheduled run
        Gardener->>Users: Scan gsi_deleted_at for users with deletedAt

        loop Each soft deleted user
            alt Grace period still active
                Gardener->>Gardener: Skip until deletedAt age reaches 10 days
            else Grace period expired
                Gardener->>Data: study-sessions: delete by userId
                Gardener->>Data: questions: delete by user scope
                Gardener->>Data: quizzes: delete by userId
                Gardener->>Data: books: delete by userId
                Gardener->>Data: user-stats: delete by userId
                Gardener->>Users: Delete user profile record
            end
        end

        Note over Gardener: requestDataExport is future-ready only. No active SES export dispatch here.
    end
